  "notes": "NOTE on drawing: CONNECTORS J1 TO J8 WIRED IDENTICAL — only J1 is drawn; these pins apply to J1-J8. SELECT bracket covers STROBE 3, 1, NALE/5, NRD (left) and STROBE 4, 2, 0, NWR (right). DATA A and DATA B are 8-bit buses (even bits 1-19 row, odd bits 20-37 row). DATA INTERCONNECTS TO CONSOLE: J1 TO J4 - INPUT CHANNELS 1 TO 48; J5 - SUBMASTER CHANNELS 1 TO 8; J6 - MONITOR CHANNELS 1 TO 4; J7 - PROGRAMMER OVERLOAD STATUS AND M5201 MACHINE CONTROL MODULE; J8 - RS8024 STEREO ROUTING SWITCHER. Page 5-1. No audio, no inserts."
